{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-extraction","title":"频谱特征提取与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis/feature-extraction","wordCount":1378,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"频谱特征提取与应用\">频谱特征提取与应用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>从波形到&quot;音乐理解&quot;不是一步完成的，而是一层层抽象的堆叠：波形 → 频谱 → 声学特征 → 音乐特征 → 语义。几个贯穿全篇的概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>特征层次</strong>：底层特征（MFCC、Chroma）描述音色与和声，中层特征（节拍、调性）描述时间与调性结构，高层语义（情感、流派）是任务目标。</li>\n<li><strong>音色特征</strong>：MFCC 编码频谱包络，频谱质心/展宽度/滚降点描述明亮度与噪声程度。</li>\n<li><strong>和声特征</strong>：Chroma 把频谱投影到 12 个音级，忽略八度，是调性与和弦分析的基础。</li>\n<li><strong>节奏特征</strong>：Onset 检测定位音符起始，Tempo 估计从 onset 序列推断 BPM。</li>\n<li><strong>学习得到的表示</strong>：大规模预训练编码器（OpenL3、CLAP）与神经音频编解码 token 正在取代手工特征。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>取舍在于特征的可解释性与表达力：手工特征维度低、可解释、适配经典分类器，但难以涵盖高层语义；学习得到的表示表达力强，但需要数据与算力，且不易解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"音频特征的层次体系\">音频特征的层次体系</h2><p>从原始音频波形到最终的音乐理解，需要经过多层特征提取。每一层将原始数据压缩为更高级、更抽象的表示：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>波形</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>频谱</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>声学特征</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>音乐特征</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>语义理解</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{波形} \\to \\text{频谱} \\to \\text{声学特征} \\to \\text{音乐特征} \\to \\text{语义理解}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">波形</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">频谱</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">声学特征</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">音乐特征</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">语义理解</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;原始波形&lt;br/&gt;44100 samples/sec&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;频谱帧&lt;br/&gt;~43 frames/sec&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;底层特征&lt;br/&gt;MFCC, Chroma&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;中层特征&lt;br/&gt;节拍, 调性&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;高层语义&lt;br/&gt;情感, 流派, 结构&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"原始波形&lt;br/&gt;44100 samples/sec\"] --&gt; B[\"频谱帧&lt;br/&gt;~43 frames/sec\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"底层特征&lt;br/&gt;MFCC, Chroma\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"中层特征&lt;br/&gt;节拍, 调性\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"高层语义&lt;br/&gt;情感, 流派, 结构\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心频谱特征\">核心频谱特征</h2><p><strong>MFCC（梅尔频率倒谱系数）</strong>：最经典的音频特征。将 Mel 语谱图取对数后做离散余弦变换（DCT），压缩为 12-20 个系数。MFCC 编码了音色（频谱包络）信息，是语音识别与音色分类的基础特征。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MFCC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>DCT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Mel filterbank</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MFCC} = \\text{DCT}(\\log(\\text{Mel filterbank}(|X[k]|^2)))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MFCC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mel filterbank</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>Chroma 特征</strong>：将频谱投影到 12 个音级（C, C♯, D, ..., B）上，忽略八度信息。Chroma 编码了和声/和弦信息，是和弦识别与调性分析的核心特征。</p>\n<p><strong>频谱质心</strong>（Spectral Centroid）：频谱的&quot;重心&quot;频率，反映音色的&quot;明亮度&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SC} = \\frac{\\sum_k k \\cdot |X[k]|^2}{\\sum_k |X[k]|^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4895em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5038em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>频谱展宽度</strong>（Spectral Spread）：频谱能量分布的宽度，区分纯音与噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>频谱滚降点</strong>（Spectral Rolloff）：包含频谱总能量 85%（或 95%）的频率分界点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>编码信息</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MFCC</td>\n<td>12-20</td>\n<td>音色/频谱包络</td>\n<td>语音识别、音色分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chroma</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>和声/音级分布</td>\n<td>和弦识别、翻唱检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频谱质心</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>明亮度</td>\n<td>音色描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZCR</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>噪声程度</td>\n<td>语音/音乐区分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RMS</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>响度</td>\n<td>能量包络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频谱平坦度</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>噪声 vs 调性</td>\n<td>有调/无调判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"节拍与节奏特征\">节拍与节奏特征</h2><p><strong>Onset Detection</strong>（起始点检测）：识别音频中新音符或新打击的起始时刻。常用方法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>能量差分：</mtext><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{能量差分：} E[m] - E[m-1] &gt; \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">能量差分：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>频谱差异：SF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{频谱差异：} \\text{SF}[m] = \\sum_k H(|X_m[k]| - |X_{m-1}[k]|)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">频谱差异：</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>Tempo Estimation</strong>（速度估计）：通过对 onset 序列做自相关或 BPM histogram，找到最显著的脉冲周期。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BPM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><mtext>beat period (seconds)</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BPM} = \\frac{60}{\\text{beat period (seconds)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BPM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">beat period (seconds)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;音频&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Onset 检测&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Onset 序列&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;自相关分析&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;BPM 估计&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;Beat Tracking&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;节拍网格&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"音频\"] --&gt; B[\"Onset 检测\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Onset 序列\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"自相关分析\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"BPM 估计\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"Beat Tracking\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"节拍网格\"]</pre><h2 id=\"音高与调性特征\">音高与调性特征</h2><p><strong>基频检测</strong>（F0 Estimation）：从复杂信号中提取音高信息。经典算法包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自相关法</strong>（Autocorrelation）：寻找信号与自身位移版本的最大相关性</li>\n<li><strong>YIN 算法</strong>：改良的差分函数方法，减少倍频/半频错误</li>\n<li><strong>CREPE</strong>：基于深度学习的端到端音高检测（2018）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>自相关：</mtext><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{自相关：} R(\\tau) = \\sum_{n=0}^{N-1} x[n] \\cdot x[n + \\tau]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自相关：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>调性检测</strong>（Key Detection）：通过将 Chroma 特征与各调的理论音级分布模板做相关性匹配：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Key</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></munder><mtext>corr</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Chroma</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>template</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Key} = \\arg\\max_k \\text{corr}(\\text{Chroma}, \\text{template}_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Key</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5021em;vertical-align:-0.7521em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">corr</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Chroma</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">template</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>准确率</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>YIN</td>\n<td>差分函数</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pYIN</td>\n<td>概率 YIN</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CREPE</td>\n<td>CNN</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPICE</td>\n<td>轻量CNN</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"深度学习时代的特征表示\">深度学习时代的特征表示</h2><p>2020 年代，传统手工设计的声学特征正在被<strong>学习得到的表示</strong>（Learned Representations）逐步替代：</p>\n<p><strong>音频嵌入</strong>（Audio Embeddings）：大规模预训练模型（如 OpenL3、VGGish、CLAP）将任意音频段编码为固定长度的向量。这些向量在高维空间中编码了丰富的语义信息。</p>\n<p><strong>离散音频 Token</strong>（Neural Audio Codecs）：EnCodec（Meta）、SoundStream（Google）使用 VQ-VAE 将音频压缩为离散 token 序列。每个 token 携带的信息等价于传统的多维特征向量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>传统：音频</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>STFT</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>手工特征</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>分类器</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{传统：} \\text{音频} \\to \\text{STFT} \\to \\text{手工特征} \\to \\text{分类器}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传统：</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">音频</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">STFT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">手工特征</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分类器</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>现代：音频</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>预训练编码器</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>嵌入向量</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>任务头</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{现代：} \\text{音频} \\to \\text{预训练编码器} \\to \\text{嵌入向量} \\to \\text{任务头}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">现代：</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">音频</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预训练编码器</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">嵌入向量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">任务头</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>2025 年的音乐信息检索（MIR）研究中，MFCC 等传统特征仍然作为基线使用，但 state-of-the-art 系统几乎全部基于深度学习表示。音乐推荐、自动标签、音乐生成等任务都依赖于强大的预训练音频编码器提取的语义特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>音频特征提取把原始波形逐层压缩为越来越抽象、越来越接近语义的表示。底层特征中，MFCC 编码音色包络，Chroma 编码和声内容，频谱质心等描述亮度与噪声程度；中层特征把 onset 与音高序列组织为节拍和调性。手工特征与学习得到的表示各有所长：前者低维、可解释、适合作为基线，后者表达力强、支撑起当代 MIR 的主流系统。理解这套层次体系，是选择合适特征与判断其适用边界的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"频谱特征提取与应用","id":"频谱特征提取与应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"音频特征的层次体系","id":"音频特征的层次体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心频谱特征","id":"核心频谱特征"},{"level":2,"text":"节拍与节奏特征","id":"节拍与节奏特征"},{"level":2,"text":"音高与调性特征","id":"音高与调性特征"},{"level":2,"text":"深度学习时代的特征表示","id":"深度学习时代的特征表示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时频分析与短时傅里叶变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis/stft-spectrogram"},"next":{"title":"EQ 均衡器与滤波器设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/audio-effects/eq-filters"}}